{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T98piSWr1ugifEmmFkeFo7","type":"tool_result","content":"1109\t    fn sumcheck_polys_batch_eval(\n1110\t        &mut self,\n1111\t        round: usize,\n1112\t        r_prev: EF,\n1113\t    ) -> Result<Vec<Vec<EF>>, LogupZerocheckError> {\n1114\t        let sp_deg = self.constraint_degree;\n1115\t\n1116\t        // Per-trace outputs (filled as we go)\n1117\t        let mut zc_out: Vec<Vec<EF>> = vec![vec![EF::ZERO; sp_deg]; self.n_per_trace.len()];\n1118\t        let mut logup_out: Vec<[Vec<EF>; 2]> =\n1119\t            vec![[vec![EF::ZERO; sp_deg], vec![EF::ZERO; sp_deg]]; self.n_per_trace.len()];\n1120\t\n1121\t        // Keep early interpolations alive for duration of kernels\n1122\t        let mut _keepalive_interpolated: Vec<DeviceMatrix<EF>> = Vec::new();\n1123\t\n1124\t        let mut late_eval: Vec<TraceCtx> = Vec::new(); // round == n_lift + 1\n1125\t        let mut early_eval: Vec<TraceCtx> = Vec::new(); // round <= n_lift\n1126\t\n1127\t        // First, handle traces in original order and split into cases\n1128\t        for (trace_idx, (&n, mats, sels, eq_3bs, public_vals, &air_idx)) in izip!(\n1129\t            self.n_per_trace.iter(),\n1130\t            self.mat_evals_per_trace.iter(),\n1131\t            self.sels_per_trace.iter(),\n1132\t            self.d_eq_3b_per_trace.iter(),\n1133\t            self.public_values_per_trace.iter(),\n1134\t            self.air_indices_per_trace.iter()\n1135\t        )\n1136\t        .enumerate()\n1137\t        {\n1138\t            let pk = &self.pk.per_air[air_idx];\n1139\t            let dag = &pk.vk.symbolic_constraints;\n1140\t            let has_constraints = dag.constraints.num_constraints() > 0;\n1141\t            let has_interactions = !dag.interactions.is_empty();\n1142\t            if !has_constraints && !has_interactions {\n1143\t                continue;\n1144\t            }\n1145\t\n1146\t            let n_lift = n.max(0) as usize;